                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game popped up in my queue during the sale - it was cheap, it looked like a fun twist on a puzzle game, so I bought it.\n\nTurns out it's a hot mess. The design is very simple, but I guess that's to be expected for a £0.60 game. However, the whole sexual orientation thing is really not implemented well. For some reason, trans people are all heterosexual (why??), and while other sexualities are super accepting of them if they are post-op (great!), they ignore the fact they are transgender if they are pre-op (very much not great). \n\nThere are much better ways to handle a topic such as this one, even if it's all done tongue-in-cheek. This honestly looks like a young teenager's idea of a funny puzzler. Just avoid it.",
